{"type":"step-attempt","step":"code-review","sessionId":"b664ae30-049b-4132-b7cb-a275e57f794a","outcome":{"verdict":"escalation","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/dedup-verified-safe/review-feedback-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"approved":true,"findings":[{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/step/io-iteration.ts","title":"Stale comment references deleted symbol `computeCodeReviewIteration`","rationale":"The JSDoc comment says 'Matches the inline formula used by getOutputTemplates and computeCodeReviewIteration.' but `computeCodeReviewIteration` was deleted in T-01. This is a comment-only issue (TC-005's `symbol\\s*\\(` pattern correctly skips it), but the stale reference misleads future readers. Fix: remove the reference to the deleted function from the comment.","line":7},{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"specrunner/changes/dedup-verified-safe/test-cases.md","title":"TC-016 expects `enrichContext` absent but tasks.md T-02 documents intentional retention","rationale":"TC-016 says `grep 'enrichContext' src/core/step/spec-review.ts` should return 0 matches, but the method exists at line 93. tasks.md T-02 explicitly documents this as deliberate: `tests/prompts/spec-review-system.test.ts` TC-003/TC-010 assert `typeof SpecReviewStep.enrichContext === 'function'`, so removal would require modifying existing tests — violating the primary acceptance criterion. The request.md acceptance criteria grep check does not name `enrichContext` (only the 4 compute functions and PROBE_SLUG), so all stated acceptance criteria are met. TC-016 was generated before the test conflict was found and was never updated. Fix: annotate TC-016 to reflect the intentional retention and the reason.","line":174}],"evidence":{"checked":17,"skipped":1,"unverified":0},"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/verification/runner.ts","title":"Loop-level skip string in `runVerificationCommands` is intentionally not in `finalizeVerificationRun`","rationale":"Line 470 has an inline `\"_(skipped — previous command failed)_\"` inside the command loop (for skipping subsequent commands after a failure). This is distinct from the gate-level skip strings in `finalizeVerificationRun`. The command loop skip and the coverage/lockfile-gate skip are separate concerns at different points in execution. Behavior is correct and preserved.","line":470},{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/step/spec-review.ts","title":"Identity `enrichContext` retained by design — pre-existing tests require it","rationale":"C8 requirement to delete `enrichContext` was blocked by existing tests (`spec-review-system.test.ts:65-66`, `pipeline-integration.test.ts:1239-1246`) that assert the method exists. tasks.md T-02 documents this explicitly. The primary acceptance criterion (no test file modifications) takes precedence over the C8 item, and request.md acceptance criteria grep check does not name `enrichContext`.","line":93}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-07T12:51:28.385Z","endedAt":"2026-08-07T12:59:23.645Z","commitOid":"2a6005e020f1f61222310ff2661b13665009d238"}
